reports/*.csv
reports/*.md
reports/task_presentation_images/
!reports/decision_table.md
!reports/README.md
# Authored decision/methodology documents contain no competition data and ARE
# tracked. Machine-generated metric tables (validation_results.csv,
# well_level_validation.csv, baseline_report.md, ...) stay ignored: they are
# derived from the competition wells and must not be redistributed.
!reports/task_interpretation.md
!reports/validation_protocol.md
!reports/feature_manifest.csv
# Authored failure analysis of the REJECTED dip-constrained alignment model.
# Contains only aggregate validation metrics already reported by the run
# owner, plus code-level reasoning; no per-well competition data.
!reports/dip_alignment_failure_analysis.md
# Synthetic harness verification of the ablation runner. No competition data:
# generated by scripts/make_synthetic_field.py, banner-stamped as such.
!reports/synthetic_ablation/
!reports/synthetic_ablation/**
# Output of the synthetic harness-verification run: no competition data, kept
# as executable proof of what the real run produces.
!reports/synthetic/
!reports/synthetic/**

